      "fine_trace_step": 5,
      "description": "When a parsed child box is larger than the current container payload remainder, vulnerable code only logs and zeroes the remaining container size. It does not destroy the oversized child and does not return `GF_ISOM_INVALID_FILE`, so the malformed child survives into the parent's ownership lists."
